        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/medic-tank/{size}/2107_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-11-19T20:15:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This was extremely more tedious than I thought it would be. I took Redeemer Fanatic, TLT, PW AA, CapCos and WW2 Bunker. To my great disapointment I forgot to plan a deck controler to help me. The last relic spirit was the last card. Apostate was stuck in a bind where he would get hit by hypersonic assault every round and bunker would use foam grenade every round. The only hero that did not have her whole deck in hand was TLT just so I could keep 18 bursts for opportune lightspeed barrage i could play as many vernal sonnata per rounds as i needed.</p>",
