        "created_at": "2016-11-19T21:38:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Got it!</p><p>http://images.akamai.steamusercontent.com/ugc/141130676907264382/61CB64EA676AB296E6DDCA84493C659CE3D525C0/</p><p>The begining of the fight was pretty hairy with a bunch of relics out, but with G.I. Bunker busting down DR and Fanatic and Ra out to chew through them all with TLTachy feeding cards and Gramps giving them more turns to attack, It went over relatively smoothly in the end.</p>",
