        "cooked": "<p>Used Greatest Legacy, Dark Visionary, Ra, Fanatic in Insula Primalis</p><p>Lead from the Front/Fortitude/Twist the Ether allowed me to soak up most of the damage Apostate threw out. Visionary had to mill through most of Apostate's deck before I saw the Relic Spirits.&nbsp;</p>",
