        "id": 184717,
        "name": "Blackfang108",
        "username": "Blackfang108",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-11-22T16:24:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I used PW Adept, CC to unlock him, too), Fanatic (regular), Regular Haka (to eat the relics), and TLT (Cards, YAY!) in the Capital.</p><p>Had to let Apostate shuffle and redraw, as the environment killed one of the Relic Spirits AFTER Haka's Savage mana ate the Runes of Maldiction.&nbsp; (D'oh!)</p><p>Got both unlocks, but I basically avoided killing Apostate for about 4 rounds.</p>",
