        "created_at": "2016-11-23T12:41:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In those cases the unlocks are only looking for targets that entered the trash and doesn't care who did it. &nbsp;In this situation Fanatic has to specifically destroy the targets and if they are under Savage Mana she isn't destroying them. &nbsp;</p>",
